WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.873
Step 1. Open the service request page, where you review and approve the results.

1.2
00:00:05.873 --> 00:00:11.153
In the encounter, select the Service Requests tab, then See Details.

2.1
00:00:11.153 --> 00:00:13.496
Step 2. Open the review card.

2.2
00:00:13.496 --> 00:00:19.486
In the Review Test Results section, each diagnostic report has its own review card.

2.3
00:00:19.486 --> 00:00:22.079
Select its header to open it.

3.1
00:00:22.079 --> 00:00:28.298
Step 3. Review the results. If a result is wrong, correct it before you approve.

3.2
00:00:28.298 --> 00:00:32.230
After approval, you cannot change the results.

4.1
00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.465
Step 4. Check the conclusion.

4.2
00:00:34.465 --> 00:00:40.579
You can edit it in the review card, but Care keeps a change only when you approve.

5.1
00:00:40.579 --> 00:00:43.093
Step 5. Select Approve Results.

5.2
00:00:43.093 --> 00:00:47.829
It is in the review card, and it opens the Confirm dialog.

6.1
00:00:47.829 --> 00:00:53.500
Step 6. Confirm the approval. In the Confirm dialog, select Approve.

6.2
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:59.102
This cannot be undone. Care sets the diagnostic report to Final.
